      "comment": "PEAKY AVENGER (2) started big odds last time but hit the ground running with a slick early split, giving a sight but fading out of it to finish sixth (17.01) at Healesville over 300m. The form out of her last race has been franked. Can atone. NANGAR MACIE (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (23.37) in a Grade 5 at Warragul. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Should be in this for a long way. PAW LARRY (5) ran a good time (22.46) winning a Grade 5 two back at Ballarat but missed the frame latest finishing fourth at Geelong. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. IMPOSTER (7) boasts a solid strike-rate over this trip.",
